   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LoRA Merge Studio - SatoDive\n1. Pick your **UNET / text encoder / VAE** in the native loaders (left).\n2. **\u2460 Setup**: choose the architecture - recommended steps / CFG / sampler are filled in.\n3. **\u2461 Slot A / \u2462 Slot B**: pick LoRAs, press **\u25b6 Run this LoRA preview** to see each one alone.\n4. **\u2463 Merge Studio**: method + weights + per-block A/B sliders, **\u25b6 Preview merge**.\n5. **\ud83d\udcbe Merge & Save LoRA** writes `models/loras/SatoDive/<name>_###.safetensors`.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## LoRA Merge Studio - SatoDive\n1. Pick your **UNET / text encoder / VAE** in the native loaders (left).\n2. **\u2460 Setup**: choose the architecture - recommended steps / CFG / sampler are filled in.\n3. **\u2461 Slot A / \u2462 Slot B**: pick LoRAs, press **\u25b6 Run this LoRA preview** to see each one alone.\n4. **\u2463 Merge Studio**: method + weights + per-block A/B sliders, **\u25b6 Preview merge**.\n5. **\ud83d\udcbe Merge & Save LoRA** writes `models/loras/SatoDive/<name>_###.safetensors`.\n"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
